  "solution": {
    "text": "Here option D is not correct as oxygen is evolved only when  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math>  is heated with conc.  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> .<br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>A.           <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/>                               <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br/><br/>B.                             <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>C.                           <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
